  "notes": "Found in a public repository and run by a computer-use agent (batch public-1). Convert any multi-course radiotherapy schedule into biologically effective dose (BED) and equivalent dose in a reference fractionation (EQD2) for one organ at risk and one tumour together, using the linear-quadratic-linear model, and estimate NTCP, TCP and radiation-induced cancer risk. Data used in the run: example. tree.json is the workflow the agent did and a second agent replayed; run.json says how.",
